{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"georges-st-pierre","name":"Georges St-Pierre","birthDate":"1981-05-19","birthPlace":"Saint-Isidore, Québec, Canada","bio":"Georges St-Pierre was born on May 19, 1981 in Saint-Isidore, Quebec, to Jim and Paulyne St-Pierre. St-Pierre had a difficult childhood, attending a school where others would steal his clothes and money. He started learning Kyokushin karate at age seven from his father and later from a Kyokushin Karate Master to defend himself against a school bully. He took up wrestling and Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu after his karate teacher died and also trained in boxing. Before turning pro as a mixed-martial artist, St-Pierre worked as a bouncer at a Montreal night club in the South Shore called Fuzzy Brossard and as a garbageman for six months to pay for his school fees.\n\nSt-Pierre has trained with a number of groups in a large variety of gyms throughout his fighting career. Prior to his fight with B.J. Penn at UFC 58, he trained at the Renzo Gracie Jiu-Jitsu Academy in New York City. St-Pierre received his brown belt in BJJ from Renzo Gracie on July 21, 2006. In September 2008, St-Pierre earned his black belt in Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu under Bruno Fernandes.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:11:46+00:00","tmdbId":74750,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/74750","credits":[{"id":"cap-winter","title":"Captain America: The Winter Soldier","character":"Georges Batroc"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/georges-st-pierre.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Taming the Beast","year":2026,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8TAryZDlMtPnZo2Vht4z29Zs6d2.jpg"},{"name":"I Kill the Bear","year":2026,"character":"","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5EJycujPz6S8kkGowVzNfde2CQU.jpg"},{"name":"UFC Rivals","year":2026,"character":"","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aCyZo2KEucfNvQA4yhgt5jbMFmC.jpg"},{"name":"Gentle Barbarians","year":2025,"char